{"de1.P2.C4": {"xac_nhan": true, "ly_do": "Dãy sắp xếp: 51, 54, 54, 55, 56, 57, 58, 58, 59, 62, 63, 65, 67, 67, 68, 69. Trung bình $=963/16=60,1875\\approx 60,19$ (a đúng). Có 3 mốt 54, 58, 67 nên b sai. Trung vị $=(58+59)/2=58,5\\ne 58$ (c sai). $Q_1=55,5$; $Q_2=58,5$; $Q_3=66$ (d đúng).", "sua_boi": "muse"}}